        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 258-CW 5-1/2 Inch Center to Center Double Lock Wrap Around Plate</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\nThis wrap around plate allows for two door bore holes with locks / knobs / levers combination to be secure. The two 2-1/8\" diameter lock bore holes are 5-1/2\" center to center from each other. It fits a 1-3/4\" thick door with 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Don-Jo 258-CW Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Steel 22  gauge (.032) construction</l>\r\n<li>Assorted finishes available</li>\r\n<li>Built-in stainless steel threaded insert for tube latch</li>\r\n<li>Long lasting and secure mounting of latch and bolt</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty stainless steel trim screws</li>\r\n<li>Permanent holding power eliminates loosening of latch mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-258-CW-specs.gif?v=1704354715\" width=\"200\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 258-CW Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> of the Don-Jo 258-CW Wrap Around Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Face Plate Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Edge Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Distance: 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/258-CW.pdf?v=1704262234\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 258-CW Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
